{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43563","headline":"西池送白二十二东归兼寄令狐相公联句 · 裴度","name":"西池送白二十二东归兼寄令狐相公联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"促坐宴回塘，送君归洛阳。\n彼都留上宰，爲我说中肠。\n威凤池边别，冥鸿天际翔。\n披云见居守，望日拜封章。\n春尽年华少，舟通景气长。\n送行欢共惜，寄远意难忘。\n东道瞻轩盖，西园醉羽觞。\n谢公深眷眄，商皓信辉光。\n旧德推三友，新篇代八行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴度","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43563.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43563","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}